#: src/components/organisms/RSVPSection.re.mjs:653
msgid ""
"This event admits players automatically. Your request will be reviewed and "
"you will be notified once a spot is confirmed."
msgstr "本活動將自動錄取球友。您的申請將經過審核，確認名額後會通知您。"

#: src/components/atoms/EventSignupButton.re.mjs:91
msgid ""
"This event is full, so leaving the event will give your spot to someone on "
"the waitlist. If you rejoin, you will join the waitlist. Are you sure you "
"want to leave this event?"
msgstr ""
"此活動已滿，所以退出活動將把您的名額給等待列表上的人。如果您重新加入，您將加"
"入等待列表。您確定要退出此活動嗎？"

#: src/components/organisms/RsvpOptions.re.mjs:347
msgid ""
"This user will be removed from the Going/Waitlist. Their position will be "
"lost if you move them back in. Are you sure you want to restrict their RSVP?"
msgstr ""
"此使用者將從參加/候補名單中移除。如果您將其重新加入，原有位置將會遺失。確定要"
"限制其報名嗎？"

